          =-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-
          |                Planet Menu                 |
          =-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-
          
          [A] Set Atmasphere combat computer
          [D] Set Sector combat computer		
          [B] Bank         
          [K] Kick an Explorer off the planet		                    
          [E] Exchange power (ExaWatts)
          [S] Exchange shields             
          [Q] Stay here and log-off  
          [P] Display Planets 
          [R] Rename Planet            
          [T] TransWarp
          [U] Upgrade Planet                              
          [V] View sector
          [W] Who's here
          [Y] Your stats
          [L] Leave
